# Cloudflare Workers static-assets deploy uploads everything in this
# directory by default (it doesn't know which files are actually meant to
# be public web assets vs. deploy tooling) -- exclude the non-asset files
# so they aren't served at e.g. usemeritai.com/Dockerfile. Nothing in these
# was ever sensitive (all public in the repo anyway), just not meant to be
# a served URL.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
wrangler.jsonc
.wrangler/
